<title>FRANCE: Coflexip Stena Q3 net up, nine months down.</title>
<headline>Coflexip Stena Q3 net up, nine months down.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to Sept 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Consolidated net				61  vs		25</p>
<p>    Operating profit			     141  vs		72</p>
<p>    Net consolidated per share (francs)   3.73  vs	    1.57</p>
<p>    Turnover				     1.269  vs	   1.162</p>
<p>NINE MONTHS</p>
<p>    Consolidated net			     26   vs		47</p>
<p>    Operating profit			    214   vs	     168</p>
<p>    Net consolidated per share	     1.84   vs	    3.14</p>
<p>    Turnover				     3.438  vs	   3.225</p>
<p>NOTE - Groupe Coflexip Stena Offshore, listed in Paris and on Nasdaq, gave the figures in a notice in financial papers.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
